              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "**ProFed Federal Credit Union** (often referred to as ProFed Credit Union) is a member-owned financial cooperative headquartered in Fort Wayne, Indiana. \n\nThe domain you queried (`www.profedcreditunion.com`) is associated with their services, and their primary official website can be found at **[profedcu.org](https://profedcu.org)**.\n\nBelow is an overview of ProFed Credit Union, including its services, eligibility requirements, and important contact information:\n\n### **Membership Eligibility**\nTo join ProFed Credit Union, you must live, work, worship, attend school, volunteer, or regularly conduct business in one of the following nine northeast Indiana counties:\n* Adams, Allen, DeKalb, Huntington, LaGrange, Noble, Steuben, Wells, and Whitley.\n\n### **Key Services**\n* **Personal Banking:** Savings and checking accounts, certificates, IRAs, and health savings accounts.\n* **Loans:** Auto loans, personal loans, mortgages, and home equity lines of credit (HELOCs).\n* **Business Services:** Business checking, savings accounts, credit cards, and business commercial loans.\n* **Digital Banking:** Online and mobile banking platforms (available on iOS and Android) for account management, mobile check deposits, and card security controls.\n* **Wealth Management:** Financial planning and advisory services through ProFed Financial Advisors.\n\n---\n\n### **Essential Information & Contacts**\n\n* **Routing Number:** `274973183`\n* **Corporate Office Address:**\n  > ProFed Credit Union Corporate Office  \n  > 1710 St. Joe River Dr.  \n  > Fort Wayne, IN 46805\n\n* **Customer Service & Contact Center:**\n  * **Phone:** 260-373-1633 or 800-752-4613 (ext. 1633)\n  * **Email:** contactus@profedcu.org\n  * **Hours:** Monday\u2013Friday, 8:30 AM to 7:30 PM (Voice & Secure Chat assistance; closed on Federal Holidays)\n\n* **Card Services (Lost or Stolen Cards):**\n  * **During Business Hours:** 260-373-1632 or 800-752-4613 (ext. 1632)\n  * **After Business Hours:** 888-373-2880\n\n* **Audio Teller (24/7 Telephone Banking):**\n  * 260-483-5537 or 800-752-4615",
